{"book":"songofsolomon","num":5,"verses":[{"en":"I am come into my garden, my sister, my spouse: I have gathered my myrrh with my spice; I have eaten my honeycomb with my honey; I have drunk my wine with my milk: eat, O friends; drink, yea, drink abundantly, O beloved.","n":1,"sm":"Lo'u tuafafine e, laʻu ava e, ua ou sau i laʻu faatoaga; ua ou tau loʻu muro atoa ma laʻu mea manogi; ua ou ‘aina laʻu meli ua sisina ifo ma laʻu meli; ua ou inu laʻu uaina ma laʻu suāsusu. Au uo e, ina taumamafa ia; aʻu uo pele e, ina feinu ia outou, feinu ia, ia malilie.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Lo'u"},{"en":"","sm":"tuafafine"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"laʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"ava"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"sau"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"laʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"faatoaga;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"tau"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"muro"},{"en":"","sm":"atoa"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"laʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"manogi;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"‘aina"},{"en":"","sm":"laʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"meli"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"sisina"},{"en":"","sm":"ifo"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"laʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"meli;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"inu"},{"en":"","sm":"laʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"uaina"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"laʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"suāsusu."},{"en":"","sm":"Au"},{"en":"","sm":"uo"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"taumamafa"},{"en":"","sm":"ia;"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"uo"},{"en":"","sm":"pele"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"feinu"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"outou,"},{"en":"","sm":"feinu"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"malilie."}]},{"en":"I sleep, but my heart waketh: it is the voice of my beloved that knocketh, saying, Open to me, my sister, my love, my dove, my undefiled: for my head i